      "comment": "Baizhu's Master: Changsheng's Contract",
      "content": "The white snake Changsheng offered each doctor a symbiotic pact: the bearer gains the secret art of healing and can reverse death, but the art spends the bearer's own life. Every bearer died young. Baizhu's master carried it before Baizhu and was the last before him.\n\nJiangli called it a poisoned chalice and begged her master not to use it on her husband. Changsheng says no mortal she contracted with, including Baizhu's master, lived long.",
