      "comment": "Baizhu's Master: The Hu Brothers",
      "content": "Old Hu and his younger brother travelled to Chenyu Vale, where the younger brother decided to leave the funeral trade. The older inherited Wangsheng Funeral Parlor, and the two never spoke again.\n\nHu Tao says this and that Baizhu 'definitely' has something to hide, adding that her grandfather did not know the specifics of Chenyu Vale medicine.",
