      "comment": "Baizhu's Master: Jiangli",
      "content": "Jiangli, Baizhu's older fellow disciple, left their master to treat her husband Jialiang and went into hiding so he would not spend his life force on him. The master's dying wish was that Jialiang be saved, and he asked Baizhu to help her family if they met.",
